# Judge runs write raw API responses here. They are large, they are the one part of this repo
# that costs money to regenerate, and they are not reproducible verdict-for-verdict -- the SDK
# offers no temperature and no seed, which is itself one of the study's findings. So the reports
# derived from them are committed and the raw transcripts are not: `make judge` re-earns them.
runs/*.jsonl
